inpnvgyxxrdkf6.jpg"}, {"id": 230872, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/wgpernjohpbhrbvw8ay8.jpg"}, {"id": 230873, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/dg3btwzatb1e12mcswjx.jpg"}], "slug": "grimmwood", "storyline": "In this game you will become one of the hardworking, god-fearing town folk that have fled the horrors of a nameless 16th century European war. There is nothing but blood, fire and pain left behind you. The one place in the world, which the war has not reached, seems to be the Great Forest, where you\u2019re headed, seeking refuge.\n\nOn your way you meet other people \u2013 strangers with strange tales to tell. You stick together, because it\u2019s your best chance to survive. Deep into the woods you build your own village. Just a few measly huts at first, it must grow and strengthen if you are to last.\n\nThe forest around you is a different world, magical and mystical, beautiful and scary. Step by step you discover ancient secrets you wish were left forgotten.", "summary": "Explore \u2013 Craft \u2013 Survive: Grimmwood is a challenging social multiplayer RPG seamlessly blending survival, roguelike and exploration. Defend your village together with up to 30 strangers in a mystical forest against the merciless monsters who unleash their wrath against your shelter every night!", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/grimmwood", "videos": [{"id": 22012, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "aCHd0yIa1DM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aCHd0yIa1DM", "title": "Highlight: Grimmwood Blitz", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aCHd0yIa1DM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 22011, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "IjhTQerSpNk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IjhTQerSpNk", "title": "Grimmwood First Gameplay Video", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IjhTQerSpNk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 22010, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gi6jKG1NK8c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gi6jKG1NK8c", "title": "Grimmwood Official